  "_help": [
    "Defensives used by the death recap. Matched by cast name. VALUES ARE APPROXIMATE - verify for the current patch and edit freely.",
    "scope: 'personal' (only helps the caster), 'external' (cast on one other player), 'group' (helps the whole party).",
    "class / spec: who can have it (spec optional). cd and duration in seconds; cd is also learned from the log when shorter.",
    "effect: dr = damage reduction (0.3 = 30%), max_hp = temporary extra max HP, absorb = shield as share of max HP,",
    "heal = instant heal as share of max HP, hps = healing per second as share of max HP, immune = true.",
    "school: 'magic' or 'physical' limits dr / immune / absorb to that kind of damage (spell school comes from the log).",
    "deflect: true = immune to new hits (incl. the hit that applies a DoT) but ticks of a DoT already on the player only get dr (Aspect of the Turtle).",
    "gcd: true = costs a global cooldown (checked on Wowhead, Nov 2026) - holding it is often right, so it is never \"should have pressed\".",
    "escape: true marks movement/freedom tools (no survival estimate) - which debuffs they actually clear is learned from logs.",
    "from_cast: true = the log has no buff on the covered players (Darkness; Aura Mastery buffs only the paladin): the whole party",
    "(or the cast target, for externals) counts as covered for 'duration' after the cast. Anti-Magic Zone keeps its per-player buff,",
    "so only players standing in it count.",
    "choice: the other talent of a choice node - when that one is pressed, this one isn't talented and isn't listed.",
    "Group/external buff and cast IDs below were checked against 51 logs (Oct 2026). Power Word: Barrier, Mass Barrier, Ancestral Protection",
    "Totem, Roar of Sacrifice and Fortitude of the Bear were never seen there - kept/omitted as noted in the README."
